      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARCHIE'S GIFT (8) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (24.32) at Bendigo. Has a good record here at this journey. Can bounce back. READY FOR ACTION (1) produced a moderate performance last time when eighth at this track over 400m behind Paw Lonnie (23.64) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Comes out of a solid form race last start. In the mix. DREAM LUCKY (7) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when second (22.40) at Ballarat and may be close to breaking through. Form here sound including two wins. Hard to beat again. PAW OPPA (2) can measure up with the right run.",
